          "OBJ-6136-1.2.01-00"
        ],
        "text": "The Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) combine economic, social and environmental pillars—livelihoods, well-being and natural systems—with ambitions for 2030. Examples are SDG 1, No Poverty; 2, Zero Hunger; 3, Good Health and Well-being; 4, Quality Education; 5, Gender Equality; 6, Clean Water and Sanitation; 8, Decent Work and Economic Growth; 12, Responsible Consumption and Production; and 13, Climate Action. Climate-related drought and flooding threaten crops, water and infrastructure, undermining livelihoods and development gains. Suitable adaptation reduces vulnerability, while reducing emissions limits further warming and protects future needs. A particular local event cannot be attributed to climate change merely because it occurred.",
        "claim_type": "factual",
        "provenance": "source_synthesised",
